98407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119045","id":4362998407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBA4Shw","user":{"login":"Hiro1307","id":43820589,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODIwNTg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43820589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiro1307","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiro1307/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-02T04:58:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-02T04:58:44Z","body":"Turns out it is a GPU driver issues. Since I am using NVIDIA, I need to restore default 3D settings, only then the issue is fixed, both for UE and Godot. @AThousandShips \n\nOpen NVIDIA Control Panel > Go to Manage 3D settings > Click Restore Defaults > Restart","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4362998407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]